1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,674
Norse Atlantic has suspended

2
00:00:01,674 --> 00:00:02,742
all of its flights.

3
00:00:03,192 --> 00:00:05,508
The first sign came on Wednesday night.

4
00:00:05,508 --> 00:00:07,765
Norse abruptly halted a wet-lease deal

5
00:00:07,765 --> 00:00:09,963
with Pakistan International Airlines,

6
00:00:09,963 --> 00:00:12,695
and PIA had to cancel two flights from the UK.

7
00:00:13,145 --> 00:00:15,719
On Thursday, the Norwegian long-haul airline

8
00:00:15,719 --> 00:00:17,592
said it will file for bankruptcy

9
00:00:17,592 --> 00:00:20,401
unless it secures short-term financing urgently.

10
00:00:20,851 --> 00:00:22,723
A day earlier, Norse called

11
00:00:22,723 --> 00:00:25,011
its financial situation critical.

12
00:00:25,011 --> 00:00:26,883
Its shares fell 85 percent.

13
00:00:27,333 --> 00:00:30,220
This year alone, the turmoil has wiped out

14
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,626
99 percent of Norse's market value.

15
00:00:32,626 --> 00:00:35,444
Its shares now sit in the Oslo exchange's

16
00:00:35,444 --> 00:00:37,300
recovery box, for companies

17
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,018
in financial uncertainty.

18
00:00:39,468 --> 00:00:41,078
Norse was founded in 2021

19
00:00:41,078 --> 00:00:44,232
to bring back budget flights across the Atlantic,

20
00:00:44,232 --> 00:00:46,486
with twelve Boeing 787 Dreamliners.

21
00:00:46,936 --> 00:00:49,378
Low-cost long-haul is a hard business.

22
00:00:49,378 --> 00:00:50,921
European jet fuel prices

23
00:00:50,921 --> 00:00:52,721
more than doubled this year,

24
00:00:52,721 --> 00:00:54,906
and Norse had not hedged its fuel.

25
00:00:55,356 --> 00:00:57,666
Norse is still in talks with investors

26
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:59,246
about a possible takeover.

27
00:00:59,246 --> 00:01:01,798
But the company says there is no guarantee

28
00:01:01,798 --> 00:01:03,318
a solution will be found.

29
00:01:03,768 --> 00:01:05,587
If you are booked with Norse,

30
00:01:05,587 --> 00:01:07,970
follow the airline's official updates.

31
00:01:07,970 --> 00:01:09,287
Our thoughts are with

32
00:01:09,287 --> 00:01:11,419
the passengers and staff affected.

33
00:01:11,869 --> 00:01:13,582
Want more stories like this?

34
00:01:13,582 --> 00:01:15,295
Follow Aviation Facts Daily.
